        ":question/problem": "![](images/63/63102dc32e44d75681b95ca5570c737224d7fd887d7c86d2b5c7a1e41a26c9f3.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(4,-4)$ and the point $X(-4,2)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle.",
