        ":question/problem": "![](images/2f/2ff035f38f5892f61d1eb037c7e39c59c8ec5104babac45224c4902152a0cfaa.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(-1,-3)$ and the point $X(1,1)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle.",
